---
import '../styles/global.css'
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>mdtask — Tasks and spec in one file</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Shantell+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>

<body class="font-sans">

<!-- ============ TOP BAR ============ -->
<header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-topbar border-b border-line-soft backdrop-blur-md backdrop-saturate-150">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-page px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-14 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 text-body font-medium">
      <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-acc">[x]</span><span class="font-mono font-semibold text-ink">mdtask</span>
    </div>
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-6 text-ui font-medium text-ink-soft">
      <a href="#simplicity" class="hidden sm:inline hover:text-ink transition-colors">Simplicity</a>
      <a href="#cli" class="hidden sm:inline hover:text-ink transition-colors">CLI</a>
      <a href="#living-specs" class="hidden sm:inline hover:text-ink transition-colors">Living specs</a>
      <a href="#cli" class="btn sm">Get started</a>
      <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Star on GitHub" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-2 -mx-1 rounded-lg text-ink-soft hover:text-ink hover:bg-bg-alt transition-colors">
        <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="pt-16 pb-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-page px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-14 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-11 lg:gap-14 items-center">
    <div class="lg:flex-[0_0_500px] lg:max-w-[500px] min-w-0">
      <h1 class="text-h1 text-ink font-mono"><span class="text-acc">[x]</span>mdtask</h1>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-h2 text-ink">Spec-first task tracking in Markdown</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-lead text-ink-soft">
        <p>Plan, track, and build software from Markdown specs.</p>
        <p>Write specs in Markdown.</p>
        <p>Keep tasks inside those specs.</p>
        <p>Use CLI and agent skills to keep work, implementation, and documentation in sync.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="actions flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-7 items-center">
        <copy-field command="npm install -g mdtask"></copy-field>
        <a class="btn" href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.01 8.01 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
          Star on GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- file card -->
    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex justify-start">
      <div class="card hero-file" style="max-width:512px;">
        <div class="card-head"><span class="tl"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="fname">docs/prd/auth.md</span></div>
        <div class="code hero-code">
          <div class="brace-block">
            <div class="ln"><span class="h"># Authentication</span></div>
            <div class="sp"></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="h">## Login</span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="dim">Users sign in with email and password.</span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="dim">Sessions last 30 days; refresh tokens rotate on every use.</span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="dim">Repeated failures are throttled per IP and per account.</span></div>
            <div class="gbrace">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.15" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 2 C17 2 17 18 17 34 C17 43 20 48 23 50 C20 52 17 57 17 66 C17 82 17 98 5 98" /></svg>
              <span class="lbl">spec</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ln dots3" style="padding-top:6px;">· · ·</div>
          <div class="sp"></div>

          <div class="brace-block">
            <div class="ln"><span class="h"># Tasks</span></div>
            <div class="ln done"><span class="box">- [</span><span class="ck">x</span><span class="box">] </span><span class="id">AUTH-001</span><span class="txt">  Add email and password login</span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="note">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="imp">**Implemented:**</span></span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="note">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;POST /auth/login verifies the password hash</span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="note">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;and issues a 30-day session cookie.</span></div>
            <div class="sp"></div>
            <div class="ln done"><span class="box">- [</span><span class="ck">x</span><span class="box">] </span><span class="id">AUTH-003</span><span class="txt">  Rotate refresh tokens on every use</span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="note">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="imp">**Implemented:**</span></span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="note">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Each refresh swaps the token, revokes the old one.</span></div>
            <div class="sp"></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="box">- [ ] </span><span class="id">AUTH-004</span><span class="txt">  Add passwordless magic-link login          !high</span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="note">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Email a one-time link that signs the user in.</span></div>
            <div class="sp"></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="box">- [ ] </span><span class="id">AUTH-005</span><span class="txt">  Rate-limit the magic-link    </span><span class="blk">@blocked_by:</span><span class="id">AUTH-004</span></div>
            <div class="ln"><span class="note">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cap requests per email and per IP once the endpoint exists.</span></div>
            <div class="gbrace">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.15" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 2 C17 2 17 18 17 34 C17 43 20 48 23 50 C20 52 17 57 17 66 C17 82 17 98 5 98" /></svg>
              <span class="lbl">tasks</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 01 — SIMPLICITY ============ -->
<section id="simplicity" class="bg-bg-alt py-20 lg:py-26">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-page grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:gap-18 lg:px-14">
    <div class="lg:order-2">
      <h2 class="text-h2 text-ink">Markdown is enough</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink-soft">Specs and tasks live together in Markdown spec files.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-body text-ink-soft">Each file shows what exists, what is planned, and what is being built.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-body text-ink-soft">No boards. No database. No workspace. Just Markdown.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card lg:order-1">
      <div class="card-head"><span class="tl"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="fname">docs/prd/auth.md</span></div>
      <div class="code">
        <div class="ln"><span class="h"># Authentication</span></div>
        <div class="sp"></div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="h">## Login</span></div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="dim">Users sign in with email and password.</span></div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="dim">Sessions last 30 days.</span></div>
        <div class="sp"></div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="h"># Tasks</span></div>
        <div class="ln done"><span class="box">- [</span><span class="ck">x</span><span class="box">] </span><span class="id">AUTH-001</span><span class="txt">  Add email and password login</span></div>
        <div class="sp"></div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="box">- [ ] </span><span class="id">AUTH-004</span><span class="txt">  Add passwordless magic-link login</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 02 — CLI ============ -->
<section id="cli" class="py-20 lg:py-26">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-page grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.85fr)_minmax(0,1.15fr)] lg:gap-18 lg:px-14">
    <div class="term lg:order-2">
      <div class="card-head"><span class="tl"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="fname">terminal</span></div>
      <div class="code">
        <div class="ln"><span class="prompt">$</span> mdtask list --tag auth --priority high</div>
        <div class="ln">  <span class="tbox">[ ]</span> <span class="tid">AUTH-004</span>  Add passwordless magic-link login</div>
        <div class="ln tblocked">  [ ] AUTH-005  Rate-limit magic-link  ⊘ blocked by AUTH-004</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:order-1">
      <h2 class="text-h2 text-ink">CLI</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink-soft">Turn Markdown specs into a task system.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-body text-ink-soft">Show open work, find blockers, filter by tags, group by custom fields,
        navigate relationships, and assign missing task IDs.</p>
      <p class="mt-7 text-body text-ink-soft">No boards. No setup. No separate task database.
        Just your specs, queried from the terminal.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 03 — FORMAT ============ -->
<section id="format" class="bg-bg-alt py-20 lg:py-26">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-14">
    <h2 class="text-h2 text-ink">It's just Markdown</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink-soft">Looks like a checkbox. Carries an ID, priority, tags, and custom fields.</p>

    <div class="card mt-9 md:-mx-20">
      <div class="card-head"><span class="tl"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="fname">docs/prd/cli.md</span></div>
      <div class="code format-code">
        <div class="ln"><span class="h"># CLI</span></div>
        <div class="ln">&nbsp;</div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="omit">...</span></div>
        <div class="ln">&nbsp;</div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="h"># Tasks</span></div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="box">- [ ] </span><span class="id">CLI-042</span><span class="txt">  Add export command    #cli !high @status:in-progress</span></div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="txt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Write task output as JSON for scripts and agents.</span></div>
        <div class="ln">&nbsp;</div>
        <div class="ln"><span class="omit">...</span></div>
        <div class="ln">&nbsp;</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 03 — LIVING SPECS ============ -->
<section id="living-specs" class="bg-panel py-20 lg:py-26">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-14">
    <h2 class="text-h2 text-ink">Living Specs</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink-soft">One commit carries the code, the task closure, and the PRD or spec update.</p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-body text-ink-soft">Agents follow a predefined skill-based workflow.
      A task is not complete until the implementation, task state, and documentation are updated together.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-page px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-14">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="mb-2 text-eyebrow uppercase text-muted">The usual way</div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="mb-3 flex min-h-8 items-center gap-2 font-hand text-base font-normal leading-tight text-drift">
              <span aria-hidden="true">x</span>
              <span>Code is shipped and the task is closed, but the <span class="underline decoration-drift/50 underline-offset-4">spec is stale</span></span>
            </div>
            <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper shadow-card">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-bg-alt px-3 py-2">
                <span class="flex gap-1"><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i></span>
                <span class="ml-1 font-mono text-xs text-muted">docs/specs/auth.md</span>
              </div>
              <div class="px-4 py-4 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink"># Authentication</div>
                <div class="h-2"></div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink">## Login</div>
                <div>Users sign in with email and password.</div>
                <div>Sessions last 30 days.</div>
                <div class="-mx-4 my-1 rounded-md border border-dashed border-drift/40 bg-drift-bg px-4 py-1 font-hand font-normal text-drift">Forgot to add magic-link login behavior</div>
                <div class="h-2"></div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink">## Password reset</div>
                <div>Users request a reset link by email.</div>
                <div class="h-2"></div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink">## Security</div>
                <div>Failed attempts are throttled per IP.</div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="relative z-20 ml-auto mr-4 -mt-7 w-11/12">
            <article class="ml-auto mr-6 mt-3 w-4/5 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper shadow-lg">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-bg-alt px-3 py-2">
                <span class="flex gap-1"><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i></span>
                <span class="ml-1 font-mono text-xs text-muted">bash</span>
              </div>
              <div class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                <div><span class="text-muted">$</span> <span class="text-ink">git show --stat a1b2c3d</span></div>
                <div class="mb-2"><span>a1b2c3d</span> AUTH-004 Add magic-link login endpoint</div>
                <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><span class="text-ink">auth/magic-link.ts</span><span class="text-muted"><span class="font-semibold text-sync">+128</span></span></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><span class="text-ink">auth/views.ts</span><span class="text-muted"><span class="font-semibold text-sync">+34</span></span></div>
                <div class="mt-1 text-muted">2 files changed, 162 insertions(+)</div>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="relative z-30 ml-5 -mt-5 w-3/4 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper p-4 shadow-lg">
              <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-1 bg-sync"></div>
              <div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sync text-xs font-semibold text-paper">✓</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-muted">AUTH-004</span>
                <span class="ml-auto text-xs font-semibold text-sync">Done</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight text-ink">Add magic-link login</div>
              <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="rounded-full border border-line bg-bg-alt px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">High</span>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-line bg-bg-alt px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink-soft">Auth</span>
                <span class="ml-auto flex size-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line bg-bg-alt text-xs font-semibold text-muted">JD</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="mb-2 text-eyebrow uppercase text-muted">With mdtask</div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="mb-3 flex min-h-8 items-center gap-2 font-hand text-base font-normal leading-tight text-sync">
              <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <span><span class="underline decoration-sync/50 underline-offset-4">Spec updated</span> in the same commit :)</span>
            </div>
            <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper shadow-card">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-bg-alt px-3 py-2">
                <span class="flex gap-1"><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i></span>
                <span class="ml-1 font-mono text-xs text-muted">docs/specs/auth.md</span>
              </div>
              <div class="px-4 py-4 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink"># Authentication</div>
                <div class="h-2"></div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink">## Login</div>
                <div>Users sign in with email and password.</div>
                <div>Sessions last 30 days.</div>
                <div class="-mx-4 bg-sync/10 px-4 font-semibold">Plus a one-time magic link that signs the user in.</div>
                <div class="h-2"></div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink">## Password reset</div>
                <div>Users request a reset link by email.</div>
                <div class="h-2"></div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink">## Security</div>
                <div>Failed attempts are throttled per IP.</div>
                <div class="h-2"></div>
                <div class="h-2"></div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-ink"># Tasks</div>
                <div>- [<span class="bg-git-add font-bold text-sync">x</span>] <span class="font-semibold text-ink">AUTH-004</span>  Add magic-link login</div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class="relative z-20 ml-auto mr-4 -mt-4 w-11/12">
            <article class="ml-auto mr-6 w-4/5 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-paper shadow-lg">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-bg-alt px-3 py-2">
                <span class="flex gap-1"><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i><i class="block size-2 rounded-full bg-dot"></i></span>
                <span class="ml-1 font-mono text-xs text-muted">bash</span>
              </div>
              <div class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm leading-tight text-ink-soft">
                <div><span class="text-muted">$</span> <span class="text-ink">git show --stat a1b2c3d</span></div>
                <div class="mb-2"><span>a1b2c3d</span> AUTH-004 Add magic-link login</div>
                <div class="-mx-4 flex justify-between gap-4 bg-sync/10 px-4"><span class="font-semibold text-ink">docs/specs/auth.md</span><span class="font-semibold text-ink"><span class="font-semibold text-sync">+3</span></span></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><span class="text-ink">auth/magic-link.ts</span><span class="text-muted"><span class="font-semibold text-sync">+128</span></span></div>
                <div class="flex justify-between gap-4"><span class="text-ink">auth/views.ts</span><span class="text-muted"><span class="font-semibold text-sync">+34</span></span></div>
                <div class="mt-1 text-muted">3 files changed, 165 insertions(+)</div>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ COMPARISON ============ -->
<section id="compare" class="bg-bg-alt py-20 lg:py-26">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-14">
    <h2 class="text-h2 text-ink">How it's different</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink-soft">Same payoff against the whole class: your spec and tasks are one git artifact —
      there's no second system to keep in sync.</p>

    <div class="mt-10 border-t border-line">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(170px,210px)_1fr] gap-2.5 lg:gap-9 py-6 px-1 border-b border-line items-start">
        <div class="text-h4 text-ink">SDD frameworks<span class="block font-mono text-ui font-medium text-muted mt-1.5">Spec Kit<br />OpenSpec</span></div>
        <div class="text-body text-ink-soft">Keep spec, plan, and tasks as separate artifacts. There's a gap between them
          where they drift. <b class="text-ink font-semibold">mdtask keeps tasks inside the spec file</b> — nothing to sync.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(170px,210px)_1fr] gap-2.5 lg:gap-9 py-6 px-1 border-b border-line items-start">
        <div class="text-h4 text-ink">Trackers<span class="block font-mono text-ui font-medium text-muted mt-1.5">GitHub Issues<br />Jira<br />Linear</span></div>
        <div class="text-body text-ink-soft">A task is a separate object tied to the repo — the issue lives in the tracker's
          database, never in your files or your diff. <b class="text-ink font-semibold">mdtask keeps the task in the same file as the
          spec</b>, under one git history.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(170px,210px)_1fr] gap-2.5 lg:gap-9 py-6 px-1 border-b border-line items-start">
